      "article_id": "a1_57ff47fa743d618b16ef9ddc",
      "headline": "Russian drone strike on Kyiv warehouse storing weapons kills at least 37",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "At least 37 people have been killed after a Russian drone struck a warehouse near Kyiv’s western suburbs that was storing “explosive objects”.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-30T08:04:22.421560+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "d8c5be7bbe4b610117fd327f4e9e04964f7215d0585c32d9b3a4643e1861f52d",
          "excerpt": "At least 37 people have been killed after a Russian drone struck a warehouse near Kyiv’s western suburbs that was storing “explosive objects”.",
          "sentence_hash": "93ec5aff62a6a7815c2d8938991847080eb5479afd562d5966de982c8573e7ed",
          "anchors": [
            "37 people"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "The attack damaged at least 50 residential buildings, including a care home for elderly and disabled people, and sparked a huge fire and explosions in the Bucha district of the Kyiv region.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-30T08:04:22.421607+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "d8c5be7bbe4b610117fd327f4e9e04964f7215d0585c32d9b3a4643e1861f52d",
          "excerpt": "The attack damaged at least 50 residential buildings, including a care home for elderly and disabled people, and sparked a huge fire and explosions in the Bucha district of the Kyiv region.",
          "sentence_hash": "360ca31da7ecb158710de8370081a3c77c9839f001163ee315b74e83e9fe37e9",
          "anchors": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "The regional governor, Tymur Tkachenko, said a further 42 people, including four children, had been injured in the strike.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-30T08:04:22.421636+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "d8c5be7bbe4b610117fd327f4e9e04964f7215d0585c32d9b3a4643e1861f52d",
          "excerpt": "The regional governor, Tymur Tkachenko, said a further 42 people, including four children, had been injured in the strike.",
          "sentence_hash": "461da02a060ec802166367da6e16972bea5f9afed8cec9957d325ded6a08ee55",
          "anchors": [
            "42 people"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "More than 370 people have been evacuated from the area and the evacuation process was continuing, the Ukrainian president, Volodymyr Zelenskyy, said.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-30T08:04:22.421686+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "d8c5be7bbe4b610117fd327f4e9e04964f7215d0585c32d9b3a4643e1861f52d",
          "excerpt": "More than 370 people have been evacuated from the area and the evacuation process was continuing, the Ukrainian president, Volodymyr Zelenskyy, said.",
          "sentence_hash": "11f3eb3ccab8d66bc234e640612761f3f48933afa5b9f36290c7f7041f43ab1f",
          "anchors": [
            "370 people",
            "and"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "The warehouse was a depot owned by the Ukrainian military and stored shells, drones and other munitions, he said in a video address.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-30T08:04:22.421724+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "d8c5be7bbe4b610117fd327f4e9e04964f7215d0585c32d9b3a4643e1861f52d",
          "excerpt": "The warehouse was a depot owned by the Ukrainian military and stored shells, drones and other munitions, he said in a video address.",
          "sentence_hash": "4992ec00da43b0cf397253243741a143d85d8eceb7507efdc4a089a6ac384760",
          "anchors": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "“The first impact was on a place where ammunition was being stored that absolutely should not have been there – a depot of the defence forces.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-30T08:04:22.421758+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "d8c5be7bbe4b610117fd327f4e9e04964f7215d0585c32d9b3a4643e1861f52d",
          "excerpt": "“The first impact was on a place where ammunition was being stored that absolutely should not have been there – a depot of the defence forces.",
          "sentence_hash": "10fae7db6ef7a6f5524b975dac45d1f6e93a390313d576b0ebc7fac3283f5249",
          "anchors": [
            "there"
          ]
        }
